            a late 'sweep' row in that bot's trades.csv with the trade's open_sig / position. The owning bot sweeps at
            once; another bot takes over after 300 s (written in the file's existing header layout).
          - Price cache live/sweep_px_<TOKEN>.json so other bots can dust-check ETH / WBTC.
