2026-10-12 01:01 MT  TP3 TARGET = ZONE RULE (Trevor 00:53 MT), replaces "N analyst levels beyond the entry"
  TP3 target lies strictly between the covered add entry and the trade avg (never at/beyond avg). Zone = entry ..
  entry + gap x f, gap = entry -> avg, f = partial_zone_f_max (new [resting] key, default 0.5) x (rung - 1) /
  (ladder_max_rungs - 1) (0 at rung 1, 0.5 at the deepest rung). Rung 1: first analyst level (main + fine) past the
  entry; deeper rungs: the farthest analyst level inside the zone. Fired trim_level_tol_atr (0.05 ATR, + trim
  front-run) before the level; must cover fees (6+6 bps + trim_network_usd). No usable level -> fee-covering minimum
  just past the entry. One TP3 covering several adds: size-weighted entry + highest rung (unchanged); if that combined
  entry is not underwater vs avg no TP3 is placed (logged). partial_levels_min/max now unused.
  Placement still needs the target beyond market (tp_market_gap), so a fee-minimum / near-entry target that the market
  has already passed is not placed (retried each tick).
  Also: tests/test_bank.py updated to the withdraw_fraction 0.55 set by the 00:23 withdraw-nudge job.
